                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this unit is not a Wizard, it can use the &apos;Unbind&apos; ability as if it had **^^Wizard (1)^^**. Otherwise, add 1 to casting rolls for this unit.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
            </selectionEntry>
